# Cloudflare Web Analytics (free, privacy-first, cookieless)
# Get your token: dash.cloudflare.com → Analytics & Logs → Web Analytics
# → select the site → copy the beacon token (32 hex chars).
# Then set it in the Pages project build env (Settings → Environment
# Variables → Production) as PUBLIC_CF_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN.
PUBLIC_CF_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
